OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies a week after electric
OL,4,Awheelchair crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has died a week after her
OL,7,Felectric wheelchair was involved in a
OL,8,Fcrash with a Land Rover Freelander,
OL,9,Fpolice said.
OL,11,FThe incident happened at about 23:00
OL,12,FGMT on Sunday 8 November on Lower
OL,13,FHatfield Road, in Bayford,
OL,14,FHertfordshire.
OL,16,FPolice said the woman, in her 70s, was
OL,17,Ftaken to hospital with serious injuries
OL,18,Fand underwent surgery. She died on
OL,19,FMonday.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
